### Get all stocks (should be empty at first)
GET https://stockwise-api-hxtg.onrender.com/api/stocks

### Add a new stock
POST https://stockwise-api-hxtg.onrender.com/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "RELIANCE"
}

### Add another stock
POST https://stockwise-api-hxtg.onrender.com/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "TCS"
}

### Try to add a duplicate stock (should fail)
POST https://stockwise-api-hxtg.onrender.com/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "RELIANCE"
}

### Get all stocks again (should now have 2 stocks)
GET https://stockwise-api-hxtg.onrender.com/api/stocks